  "title": "Edamame and Chipotle Dip",
  "blurb": "A smooth, vibrant dip made from edamame beans blended with lime, chipotle and coriander. Serve with vegetable sticks or tortilla chips.",
  "steps": [
    "Place the thawed edamame beans in a food processor with the lime juice, chipotle pepper, coriander, garlic, olive oil, black pepper and salt.",
    "Blend until smooth, scraping down the sides once or twice.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning with more salt, lime juice or chipotle if needed.",
    "Transfer to a serving bowl and serve immediately, or cover and chill until ready to serve."
